%bcond check 1
%global debug_package %{nil}
%global crate rpds
Name:           rust-rpds
Version:        1.2.0
Release:        1%{?dist}
Summary:        Persistent data structures with structural sharing
License:        MIT
URL:            https://crates.io/crates/rpds
Source0:        https://static.crates.io/crates/rpds/rpds-%{version}.crate
Patch:          rpds-fix-metadata.diff
# oreon:deps
BuildRequires:  cargo
BuildRequires:  cargo-rpm-macros
BuildRequires:  rustc
# /oreon:deps
%description

%package        devel
Summary:        %{summary}
BuildArch:      noarch
%description    devel

This package contains library source intended for building other packages which
use the "%{crate}" crate.

%package     -n %{name}+default-devel
Summary:        Persistent data structures with structural sharing
BuildArch:      noarch
%description -n %{name}+default-devel

This package contains library source intended for building other packages which
use the "default" feature of the "%{crate}" crate.

%package     -n %{name}+rayon-devel
Summary:        Persistent data structures with structural sharing
BuildArch:      noarch
%description -n %{name}+rayon-devel

This package contains library source intended for building other packages which
use the "rayon" feature of the "%{crate}" crate.

%package     -n %{name}+serde-devel
Summary:        Persistent data structures with structural sharing
BuildArch:      noarch
%description -n %{name}+serde-devel

This package contains library source intended for building other packages which
use the "serde" feature of the "%{crate}" crate.

%package     -n %{name}+std-devel
Summary:        Persistent data structures with structural sharing
